# OS Code app build-time env. Copy to .env.local and fill in. Everything here is
# OPTIONAL: with all of it blank, OS Code runs local-first with no accounts and
# no billing, exactly as before. Only VITE_-prefixed vars reach the client, and
# only public values ever belong here (never a service-role or secret key).

# --- Sign-in (Supabase) ---
# From the Supabase project: Settings -> API. The anon key is public by design.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Billing (Stripe) ---
# The publishable key is safe to ship. Seats are purchased on the web
# (openshore.ai/os-code), never inside the iOS app (Apple 3.1.1).
VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# --- Entitlement verification ---
# The PUBLIC half of the Ed25519 pair the entitlement-claim edge function signs
# with (base64url). Public by design; the private half is a Supabase function
# secret and must NEVER appear here.
VITE_ENTITLEMENT_PUBLIC_KEY=
